### Practice Routing - uji REST API /api/students
### Jalankan dulu server: node server.js
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@id = 1

### Cek server hidup
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### CREATE — tambah mahasiswa
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Budi Santoso",
  "major": "Informatika",
  "gpa": 3.75
}

### READ ALL — semua mahasiswa
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students

### READ ONE — mahasiswa berdasarkan id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students/{{id}}

### UPDATE — ubah data mahasiswa
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/students/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Budi Santoso",
  "major": "Sistem Informasi",
  "gpa": 3.80
}

### DELETE — hapus mahasiswa
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/students/{{id}}

### Uji error — id yang tidak ada (harus 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students/999999
